msgid ""
"To help us understand how you use MeshInspector and make it better, we'll "
"collect data on the tools you click on. This will give us insights to "
"improve functionality and usability.\n"
"\n"
"No personal info or file data is collected, and you can opt out anytime in "
"the settings."
