msgid ""
"Simplification stops just before shape error (or the shortest edge length) "
"becomes more than allowed value"
msgstr ""
"La simplification s'arrête juste avant que l'erreur de forme (ou la longueur "
"de la plus courte arête) ne dépasse la valeur autorisée"

msgid ""
"Stop the decimation as soon as the estimated distance deviation from the "
